{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALREADY PLAYED BY 1,000,000+ HEROES WORLDWIDE \u2014 NOW ON STEAM!</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two years of updates, thousands of crafted weapons, countless epic battles \u2014 <i>Battlesmiths: Blade &amp; Forge</i> finally comes to Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your town, forge powerful gear, lead your squad into epic PvP and PvE battles \u2014 and prove you are the mightiest battlesmith in the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/0b67747d11cb77e4113b8ed6c124f532.poster.avif?t=1756983351\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/0b67747d11cb77e4113b8ed6c124f532.webm?t=1756983351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/0b67747d11cb77e4113b8ed6c124f532.mp4?t=1756983351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE FORGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Battlesmiths</i>, gear isn\u2019t loot \u2014 it\u2019s the result of your labor. Weapons and armor are crafted by you and directly affect how your heroes look and fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons, armor, and powerful runes.\u00a0Enchant armor to customize your squad. Customize the appearances of every hero the way you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experiment with builds, enhance gear, and create combinations no enemy can predict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/690a78a75801b80f95c2f985e2b972be.poster.avif?t=1756983351\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://sha