/extras/bf4f12f598a022d31cb7c3509ef729bc.webm?t=1756983351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/bf4f12f598a022d31cb7c3509ef729bc.mp4?t=1756983351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLANS AND EPIC BOSSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Join a clan or create your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle massive bosses, share resources and help your teammates grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/42947aedc7504db926f4028de2ec24cf.poster.avif?t=1756983351\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/42947aedc7504db926f4028de2ec24cf.webm?t=1756983351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/42947aedc7504db926f4028de2ec24cf.mp4?t=1756983351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVENTS AND CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Daily quests, regular events, unique limited-time rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There\u2019s always a new goal to strive for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/25dcdcefc34e957c0d4ae550f7d6e2a5.poster.avif?t=1756983351\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/25dcdcefc34e957c0d4ae550f7d6e2a5.webm?t=1756983351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583940/extras/25dcdcefc34e957c0d4ae550f7d6e2a5.mp4?t=1756983351\" 